content.text:
{
  "body": "This term \"tinea unguium\" refers to a fungal infection of the nails. However, the exact synonyms include infections of various other body parts. These seem to have been added by mistake.\n\nFor example:\ncellulitis and abscess of buttock\ncellulitis and abscess of face\ncellulitis and abscess of gluteal region\ncellulitis and abscess of trunk\ncellulitis and abscess of upper arm and forearm",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "IC_kwDOBjach87ykHkW",
      "author": {
        "login": "matentzn"
      },
      "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
      "body": "This will be a tough nut to crack in the big picture. All of these come from DO, and are still in there:\n\nhttps://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/doid/classes/http%253A%252F%252Fpurl.obolibrary.org%252Fobo%252FDOID_13074\n\n@sabrinatoro what is your take? \n\n1. Fix these 1 by 1\n2. Do something drastic more large scale?\n",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-16T17:55:07Z",
      "includesCreatedEdit": false,
      "isMinimized": false,
      "minimizedReason": "",
      "reactionGroups": [],
      "url": "https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/10030#issuecomment-4069554454",
      "viewerDidAuthor": false
    },
    {
      "id": "IC_kwDOBjach87ykH64",
      "author": {
        "login": "matentzn"
      },
      "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
      "body": "Thank you @eks-ebi super useful!",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-16T17:55:20Z",
      "includesCreatedEdit": false,
      "isMinimized": false,
      "minimizedReason": "",
      "reactionGroups": [
        {
          "content": "THUMBS_UP",
          "users": {
            "totalCount": 1
          }
        }
      ],
      "url": "https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/10030#issuecomment-4069555896",
      "viewerDidAuthor": false
    },
    {
      "id": "IC_kwDOBjach87yk-H2",
      "author": {
        "login": "sabrinatoro"
      },
      "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
      "body": "@matentzn we discussed this in the past (We can follow-up in a meeting)\nWe need a more drastic-large scale approach.",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-16T18:35:25Z",
      "includesCreatedEdit": false,
      "isMinimized": false,
      "minimizedReason": "",
      "reactionGroups": [],
      "url": "https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/10030#issuecomment-4069777910",
